<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{root}}assets/css/about.css">
<section class="about">
	<div class="inner">
		<div class="about__wrapper">
			<div class="about__left">
				<h1 class="title">Our Story</h1>
				<p class="about__p">Owner Charlie Hope founded Hope Brothers on the very same pillars that he and
					countless others have relied on to defend this country —values of integrity, service, and
					excellence.</p>
				<p class="about__p">As a full-service, veteran owned and operated real estate company, we make it our
					mission to provide you with investment sales through world-class customer service, professionalism,
					and value generation.</p>
				<p class="about__p color-blue">For any owner of self storage, manufactured housing, or multifamily
					assets looking to invest or divest, it is our pleasure to provide you with advisory, marketing, and
					transactional brokerage services.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="about__right">
				<h2 class="about__h2">We're honored to be described as “top tier in all regards” and “comparable to
					national firms.”</h2>
				<p class="about__p">With descriptions like this from valuable clients, like you, we make it our mission
					to take every occasion to deliver excellent investment sales opportunities with professionalism and
					integrity in every transaction.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

